  "description": "<p>In-line XML datastreams migrated from Fedora 3 to OCFL do not contain an XML declaration. This declaration is is optional in XML 1.0, but common practice.  It is mandatory in XML 1.1. </p>\n\n<p>Please consider adding a declaration such as:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?&gt;</p>",
